# Optional. The solver discovers BioNetGen automatically from the installed
# `bionetgen` package (see sim/vervain/solve/engine.py: ensure_bngpath), picking
# bng-linux / bng-mac / bng-win to match the host. Set BNGPATH only to override
# that — e.g. to point at a system BioNetGen install. An explicit value always wins.
#
# BNGPATH=/opt/bionetgen

# Websocket bind address for the solver server.
# VERVAIN_HOST=127.0.0.1
# VERVAIN_PORT=8765
